Opt-in package: scripts/build-packages.sh skips any package dir carrying a file
named OPTIONAL unless the package is named explicitly:

  sudo make packages PKG=gamescope-next

A plain `make packages` / `make build` never builds it, so this experimental
artifact cannot reach localrepo (and an RC) by accident.
See PKGBUILD header and docs/rotation-experiment-2026-09-20.md.
